<div class="page-head">
  <div><h1>Learn</h1>
    <p class="small" style="margin:4px 0 0">Guides and tools to help you use your account with confidence.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="grid g3">
  <a class="card card--hover" href="/education">
    <div class="plan-head">
      <span class="badge badge-blue">Education hub</span>
      <h3 style="margin-top:10px">Markets explained</h3>
    </div>
    <p class="small" style="color:var(--ink-3);margin-top:8px">Plain-language guides to crypto, indices, forex and the terminology traders use.</p>
    <p class="go" style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:14px">Start learning <span>→</span></p>
  </a>

  <a class="card card--hover" href="/dashboard/markets">
    <div class="plan-head">
      <span class="badge badge-live">Live charts</span>
      <h3 style="margin-top:10px">Market overview</h3>
    </div>
    <p class="small" style="color:var(--ink-3);margin-top:8px">Explore live prices, charts and screeners before placing a trade.</p>
    <p class="go" style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:14px">Open markets <span>→</span></p>
  </a>

  <a class="card card--hover" href="/dashboard/invest">
    <div class="plan-head">
      <span class="badge badge-yellow">Investment plans</span>
      <h3 style="margin-top:10px">Put capital to work</h3>
    </div>
    <p class="small" style="color:var(--ink-3);margin-top:8px">Fixed-term plans with periodic returns and principal returned at maturity.</p>
    <p class="go" style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:14px">Browse plans <span>→</span></p>
  </a>
</div>

<div class="card" style="margin-top:22px">
  <div class="card-head"><h3>Quick start</h3></div>
  <div class="row" style="gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-top:6px">
    <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/dashboard/deposit">Deposit funds</a>
    <a class="btn btn-quiet btn-sm" href="/dashboard/trade">Make a trade</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/dashboard/kyc">Verify identity</a>
  </div>
  <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:14px">Your account balance is always the sum of your statement — you can audit every line at
    <a href="/dashboard/statement" style="color:var(--blue-hi)">Account statement</a>.</p>
</div>